<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="55c8934d">&lt;p&gt;
    This work product identifies the gaps in skills, capabilities, and knowledge between how the impacted audiences
    currently perform their roles and how they will be expected to perform in the future. In larger projects, two needs
    analyses may need to be completed: a high-level one giving an indication of learning needs per team, and a more
    detailed one later in the project.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
